<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's Dec 1-20 palm oil exports 468,439t - SGS.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's Dec 1-20 palm oil exports 468,439t - SGS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo surveyor, Societe Generale de Surveillance (SGS) Malaysia Sdn Bhd said on Friday it estimated Malaysia's palm oil exports for December 1-20 at 468,439 tonnes compared with 462,394 tonnes for Nov 1-20.</p>
<p>It said the exports comprised 147,460 tonnes of RBD palm oil, 163,141 tonnes of RBD palm olein and 48,322 tonnes of RBD palm stearin. The other products accounted for 109,516 tonnes.</p>
</text>
